// The editor's icon as a resource of kerf-editor.exe, compiled in by the
// crate's build.rs (embed-resource). Windows takes the first icon in a program
// for the program's own, so it stays the first, and the only one.
// The .ico is made from industrial-kerf.svg by tools/kerf-icon.
IDI_ICON1 ICON "industrial-kerf.ico"
